{"book":"psalms","num":37,"verses":[{"en":"Fret not thyself because of evildoers, neither be thou envious against the workers of iniquity.","n":1,"sm":"O upu apoapoai ta le tiga i","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"O"},{"en":"words","sm":"upu"},{"en":"exhorting","sm":"apoapoai"},{"en":"we two","sm":"ta"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"pain","sm":"tiga"},{"en":"","sm":"i"}]},{"en":"For they shall soon be cut down like the grass, and wither as the green herb.","n":2,"sm":"tagata amio leaga,","w":[{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"evil","sm":"leaga,"}]},{"en":"Trust in the LORD, and do good; so shalt thou dwell in the land, and verily thou shalt be fed.","n":3,"sm":"a ia faatuatua i le alofa o","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"of","sm":"ia"},{"en":"faith","sm":"faatuatua"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"love","sm":"alofa"},{"en":"of","sm":"o"}]},{"en":"Delight thyself also in the LORD; and he shall give thee the desires of thine heart.","n":4,"sm":"le Atua O le salāmo a Tavita.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"god","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"of","sm":"O"},{"en":"the","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"salāmo"},{"en":"of","sm":"a"},{"en":"David","sm":"Tavita."}]},{"en":"Commit thy way unto the LORD; trust also in him; and he shall bring it to pass.","n":5,"sm":"Aua e te faameo","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Aua"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"you shall not","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"faameo"}]},{"en":"And he shall bring forth thy righteousness as the light, and thy judgment as the noonday.","n":6,"sm":"ona o e amio leaga; aua fo:","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"evil","sm":"leaga;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"fo:"}]},{"en":"Rest in the LORD, and wait patiently for him: fret not thyself because of him who prospereth in his way, because of the man who bringeth wicked devices to pass.","n":7,"sm":"e ie losilosi ona o e fai mea leaga.","w":[{"en":"who","sm":"e"},{"en":"cloth","sm":"ie"},{"en":"","sm":"losilosi